---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Wenatchee Well Pros"
  description="Privacy Policy for wenatcheewellpros.com."
  canonical="https://wenatcheewellpros.com/privacy/"
>
<Fragment slot="head">
<style is:global>
  .rich p { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #555; margin: 0 0 16px; }
  .rich ul { padding-left: 20px; margin: 0 0 16px; }
  .rich li { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #555; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .rich strong { color: #333A3F; }
  .rich a { color: #B96A2C; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
  .rich a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
</Fragment>

<section style="padding:64px 24px;">
  <div style="max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;">
    <h1 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,42px);margin:0 0 24px;">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p style="font-size:13px;color:#888;margin:0 0 32px;">Last updated: June 10, 2026</p>
    <div class="rich"><p>Wenatchee Well Pros ("we", "us") respects your privacy. This policy explains what we collect and how we use it.</p>
<p><strong>What we collect.</strong> When you submit our contact form we receive the name, phone number, city, and message you provide. Our website also uses standard server logs and may use basic analytics that record pages visited, approximate location, and device type.</p>
<p><strong>How we use it.</strong> Contact details are used only to respond to your request, schedule service, and provide estimates. We do not sell or rent your personal information.</p>
<p><strong>Third parties.</strong> Form submissions are delivered through our form processing provider. Analytics data, where enabled, is processed by the analytics provider. These services receive only the data needed to perform their function.</p>
<p><strong>Retention.</strong> We keep inquiry records only as long as needed to serve you and meet legal obligations.</p>
<p><strong>Your choices.</strong> You may request access to or deletion of your information by emailing info@wenatcheewellpros.com.</p>
<p><strong>Changes.</strong> We may update this policy; the latest version will always be posted on this page.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>
</Layout>
